<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>MCP on ByF (BaiFan) · 每日深度思考</title><link>https://blog.baifan.site/tags/mcp/</link><description>Recent content in MCP on ByF (BaiFan) · 每日深度思考</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>blog@baifan.site (ByF (BaiFan))</managingEditor><webMaster>blog@baifan.site (ByF (BaiFan))</webMaster><copyright>CC BY-NC 4.0</copyright><lastBuildDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 16:25:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.baifan.site/tags/mcp/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>AI Agent 的 Skill 与 MCP 工具选型：实用场景与维护成本评估</title><link>https://blog.baifan.site/ai-agent-skills-mcp-review/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Jul 2026 14:00:00 +0800</pubDate><author>blog@baifan.site (ByF (BaiFan))</author><guid>https://blog.baifan.site/ai-agent-skills-mcp-review/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;开源社区每天都在涌现海量 Agent 扩展与 MCP 服务，但超过九成的扩展在装上之后便永久吃灰。工具链的价值在于其调用契约与上下文开销是否可控。以下从长期实测的高频工具中按真实场景分类梳理。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>MCP 协议：AI 工具互联的 USB-C</title><link>https://blog.baifan.site/claude-code-mcp-protocol/</link><pubDate>Fri, 12 Jun 2026 09:00:00 +0800</pubDate><author>blog@baifan.site (ByF (BaiFan))</author><guid>https://blog.baifan.site/claude-code-mcp-protocol/</guid><description>&lt;!-- more --&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;在 MCP 出现之前，每个 AI 工具集成都是一次&lt;strong&gt;定制开发&lt;/strong&gt;。想让 ChatGPT 连数据库？写一个插件。想让 Claude 调 GitHub API？写一个 Function Calling 定义。想让 Copilot 访问你的内部系统？写一个 Custom Tool。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>基于 MCP 的 Claude Skills 渐进式披露实现</title><link>https://blog.baifan.site/mcp-claude-skills-progressive-disclosure/</link><pubDate>Fri, 26 Dec 2025 14:00:00 +0800</pubDate><author>blog@baifan.site (ByF (BaiFan))</author><guid>https://blog.baifan.site/mcp-claude-skills-progressive-disclosure/</guid><description>&lt;figure&gt;&#10; &lt;img&#10; class="my-0 rounded-md"&#10; loading="lazy"&#10; decoding="async"&#10; fetchpriority="auto"&#10; alt="Claude Code Skill in Anywhere"&#10; width="2560"&#10; height="1440"&#10; src="https://blog.baifan.site/pictures/note/claudecodeskills_hu_3030e75c3d7e5ea7.png"&#10; srcset="https://blog.baifan.site/pictures/note/claudecodeskills_hu_3030e75c3d7e5ea7.png 800w,/pictures/note/claudecodeskills_hu_48299efe0d2363fe.png 1280w"&#10; sizes="(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 65vw"&#10; data-zoom-src="https://blog.baifan.site/pictures/note/claudecodeskills.png"&#10; /&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;figcaption&gt;Claude Code Skill in Anywhere&lt;/figcaption&gt;&#10; &lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;将专业知识与流程规范封装为模块化技能包并在推理时按需加载，是控制模型初始上下文体积并保持长任务稳定性的关键手段。基于标准 MCP 协议构建动态能力加载层，能够让任意兼容客户端在无需原生技能树支持的前提下实现渐进式披露。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>